	"name": "Bamboo-cutter’s Burden",
	"system": {
		"description": {
			"gm": "",
			"value": "<p>This long piece of wood can aid in walking and deliver a mighty blow.</p><hr><p><strong>Activate—Bamboo-cutter's Burden</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (interact)</p><p><strong>Frequency</strong> once</p><hr><p><strong>Effect</strong> When unsealed, Bamboo-cutter's Burden causes a wave of sharpened bamboo stakes to erupt from the ground in a @Template[type:cone|distance:50], dealing @Damage[12d6[piercing]] damage and @Damage[2d6[bleed]] damage (@Check[reflex|dc:41|basic] save); on a critical failure, enemies are also pushed to the end of the cone; and this item permanently dissipates into mist.</p>"
		},
